		"Cassette Beasts is made for 16:9 screens. 16:9 letterbox shows exactly that view, with bars above and below. Expanded view uses the whole screen and shows more above and below, but the game runs noticeably slower (potentially a third fewer frames per second). Some scenes may look odd in it, because you see more than the game was made to show. You can change this later in {path}.",
